<!DOCTYPE html>
<!-- Hello there! You have opened page's html source! This website is open source btw, so check out github page in footer for full code! -->
<html lang="en" data-theme="vs-dark">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Silvermoon</title>
    <meta name="description" content="A HTML preprocessor with power of lua." />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/x-icon" href="/resources/images/favicon.ico" />

    <meta
      name="google-site-verification"
      content="vCZFGHiY9HGl0N7785E_M9J2q-rbzslKDbHvRpGQvsw"
    />

    <!-- Connect style sheets -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/resources/css/shared/global.css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/resources/css/shared/header.css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/resources/css/shared/footer.css" />

    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/resources/css/docs/main.css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/resources/css/docs/markdown.css" />

    <!-- Other sources -->
    <!-- Bootstrap icons -->
    <link
      rel="stylesheet"
      href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.13.1/font/bootstrap-icons.min.css"
    />

    <!-- Google fonts -->
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Geist:ital,wght@0,100..900;1,100..900&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />

    <!-- Highlight.js -->
    <link
      rel="stylesheet"
      href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/highlight.js/11.11.1/styles/atom-one-dark.min.css"
    />
    <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/highlight.js/11.12.0/highlight.min.js"></script>

    <!-- Google stuff -->
    <script type="application/ld+json">
      {
        "@context": "https://schema.org",
        "@type": "WebSite",
        "name": "Silvermoon",
        "url": "https://silvermoon.up.railway.app"
      }
    </script>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header>
      <a class="logo-container" href="/" aria-label="Go to main page">
        <img src="/resources/images/logo.svg" alt="Silvermoon logo" />
      </a>
      <nav>
        <a href="/docs"
          ><i class="bi bi-journal-code" aria-hidden="true"></i>Documentation</a
        >
        <a href="/docs/getting-started/#Install"
          ><i class="bi bi-download" aria-hidden="true"></i>Install</a
        >
        <a href="https://github.com/IEatUranium238/silvermoon"
          ><i class="bi bi-github" aria-hidden="true"></i>GitHub</a
        >
        <button
          class="invisible square change-mode-button"
          aria-label="Change theme button"
        >
          <i class="bi bi-moon-stars" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        </button>
      </nav>
      <button class="invisible square" id="headerBurger" aria-label="Open menu">
        <i class="bi bi-list" aria-hidden="true"></i>
      </button>
    </header>

    <main>
      <article class="markdown">
        <h1>Silvermoon's website privacy policy</h1>
        <p>Last updated: October 24, 2026</p>
        <br />
        <p>
          This Privacy Policy explains what information Silvermoon's website
          ("we", "us", "our"), available at silvermoon.up.railway.app, collects
          when you visit, and how it is used. We aim to collect as little as
          possible.
        </p>

        <h2>Summary</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>We don't use cookies</li>
          <li>
            We don't ask for, collect or store any personal information such as
            names, account passwords or other
          </li>
          <li>
            Our hosting provider may automatically process technical request
            data, including IP addresses and browser information, as described
            below.
          </li>
          <li>
            We use Google Search Console to understand how the site performs in
            Google Search
          </li>
        </ul>

        <h2 style="margin-top: -2px">Information we collect</h2>

        <h3 style="margin-top: -2px">Server logs (web hosting)</h3>
        <p>
          This website is hosted on <a href="https://railway.com/">Railway</a>.
          When you visit, it may automatically log the following information:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>
            Resource's address (such as page's content, images and other) your
            web browser has requested
          </li>
          <li>
            Your browser's user agent (browser type, version, and operating
            system)
          </li>
          <li>Your public IP address</li>
          <li>The date and time of the request</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          Logs are retained by Railway according to its own retention practices.
          <br />
          See
          <a href="https://railway.com/legal/privacy"
            >Railway's Privacy Policy</a
          >
          for details.
        </p>

        <h3>Google Search Console</h3>
        <p>
          We use Google Search Console to monitor how our site appears in Google
          Search results.
          <br />
          Search Console does not place any tracking code on this website or
          collect data from you while you browse it.
          <br />
          It provides us with aggregated information collected by Google from
          Google Search, such as search queries that led to our site,
          impressions, clicks, and indexing or technical issues.
          <br />
          We cannot identify individual visitors from this data.
        </p>
        <br />
        <p>
          Google processes that data under its own policies, see
          <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy"
            >Google's Privacy Policy</a
          >.
        </p>
        <h3>Cookies</h3>
        <p>
          This website doesn't use cookies or tracking technologies that require
          them.
        </p>
        <h3>User settings and preferences</h3>
        <p>
          This website stores preferences, such as your selected interface
          theme, in your browser's local storage. These preferences are not
          transmitted to our servers by the website's preference functionality.
          <br />
          They remain on your device until you clear them or the website removes
          them.
        </p>

        <h2>How we use this information</h2>
        <p>
          We use information described above only for the following purposes:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>Website delivery and security</li>
          <li>Technical diagnostics</li>
          <li>Study how the site appears in search results</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          We do not sell or rent visitor personal data. We rely on Railway to
          host the website and process technical request data as necessary to
          deliver and secure the service. Please see
          <a href="https://railway.com/legal/privacy"
            >Railway's Privacy Policy</a
          >
        </p>

        <h2>Third parties</h2>
        <p>The third parties involved are:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Railway - our hosting provider, which collects request data</li>
          <li>
            Google - through Search Console and Search, as described above
          </li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Your rights</h2>
        <p>
          Depending on where you live (for example, in the European Economic
          Area or UK under the GDPR), you may have rights to access, correct,
          delete, or restrict the processing of personal data about you, and to
          object to its processing.
        </p>
        <br />
        <p>
          Because we do not maintain records that identify individual visitors,
          we may be unable to link log data to a specific person.
        </p>
        <br />
        <p>
          We process technical request data where necessary for website
          delivery, maintenance and security. Our legal basis is our legitimate
          interest in operating and protecting the website, where those
          interests are not overridden by your rights and freedoms.
        </p>

        <h2>Children's privacy</h2>
        <p>
          This website is not directed at children, and we do not knowingly
          collect personal information from anyone, including children.
        </p>

        <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
        <p>
          We may update this policy from time to time. Changes will be posted on
          this page with a new "Last updated" date.
        </p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>
          If you have questions about this policy, contact the website owner at
          email address:
          <a href="mailto:ieaturanium00@gmail.com">ieaturanium00@gmail.com</a>
        </p>
      </article>
    </main>

    <footer>
      <div class="list">
        <a
          href="https://github.com/IEatUranium238/silvermoon-web"
          target="_blank"
          >Website source</a
        >
        <a href="/logo">Silvermoon's Logo</a>
        <a href="/privacy">Privacy policy</a>
      </div>
      <hr />
      <div class="other">
        <div class="text">
          <p>
            Made with ❤️, running Silvermoon version
            <lua>return sm.VERSION</lua>
          </p>
          <p>
            <a href="https://lua.org" target="_blank">Lua</a>
            is owned by PUC-Rio. Trademarks are the property of their respective
            owners.
          </p>
        </div>
        <a href="/mascot" class="mascot"
          ><img
            src="/resources/images/mascot.svg"
            alt="Silver the cat, mascot of Silvermoon"
        /></a>
      </div>
    </footer>

    <div class="hidden" id="menu">
      <div class="top">
        <button
          class="invisible square big-font change-mode-button"
          aria-label="Change theme button"
        >
          <i class="bi bi-moon-stars" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        </button>
        <button
          class="invisible square big-font"
          aria-label="Close menu"
          id="closeMenu"
        >
          <i class="bi bi-x-lg" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        </button>
      </div>
      <nav>
        <a href="/docs" class="big-font"
          ><i class="bi bi-journal-code" aria-hidden="true"></i>Documentation</a
        >
        <a href="/docs/getting-started/#Install" class="big-font"
          ><i class="bi bi-download" aria-hidden="true"></i>Install</a
        >
        <a href="https://github.com/IEatUranium238/silvermoon" class="big-font"
          ><i class="bi bi-github" aria-hidden="true"></i>GitHub</a
        >
      </nav>
    </div>

    <script src="/resources/js/changeMode.js"></script>
    <script src="/resources/js/menu.js" defer></script>
    <script defer>
      hljs.highlightAll();
    </script>
  </body>
</html>
